{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-cutting","title":"横切关注点","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dependency-injection-mobile","title":"移动端依赖注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/dependency-injection-mobile","wordCount":1019,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-routing-patterns","title":"导航与路由模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/navigation-routing-patterns","wordCount":856,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-management-mobile","title":"移动端状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/state-management-mobile","wordCount":1212,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"横切关注点\">横切关注点</h1><p>依赖注入、导航路由、状态管理——这三个主题在任何移动端架构中都不属于某一层，而是横切所有层。选什么架构模式（MVC/MVVM/MVI/TCA）决定了你的&quot;垂直切面&quot;，而本章讨论的三个横切关注点决定了各层之间如何连接、如何通信、如何共享数据。忽略它们，再优雅的分层也会在工程落地时变成耦合的泥潭。</p>\n"}